{"version":1,"content":"<p>早前，黃大仙下邨發生一宗奪命火災，死者是一名獨居的80歲婆婆。</p><p>報道指，單位內發現大量雜物，部分更堆積至天花板。</p><p>每次聽到這類新聞，心裏總特別難過，不禁想：這些獨居長者是否很寂寞？</p><p>很少人關心？</p><p>家中堆滿雜物，是否因為缺乏安全感？</p><p>以上純粹是一種猜想</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.762644+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T04:00:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:12.893863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:12.893863+00:00","content_hash":"4f34d212e3bcb4effe8cb7ab54175aaa0be611870a8e998ede09638708b17596","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}